    Array(6, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.einsum(x, (0,), ())  # explicit form via indices
    Array(6, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.sum(x)
    Array(6, dtype=int32)

    **Sum along an axis**

    >>> jnp.einsum("...j->...", M)  # requires explicit form
    Array([ 6, 22, 38, 54], dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.einsum(M, (..., 0), (...,))  # explicit form via indices
    Array([ 6, 22, 38, 54], dtype=int32)
    >>> M.sum(-1)
