    Array([[1, 4],
           [2, 5],
           [3, 6]], dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.transpose(y)
    Array([[1, 4],
           [2, 5],
           [3, 6]], dtype=int32)

    **Matrix diagonal**

    >>> jnp.einsum("ii->i", M)
    Array([ 0,  5, 10, 15], dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.diagonal(M)
    Array([ 0,  5, 10, 15], dtype=int32)

    **Matrix trace**

    >>> jnp.einsum("ii", M)
    Array(30, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.trace(M)
    Array(30, dtype=int32)

    **Tensor products**

    >>> x = jnp.arange(30).reshape(2, 3, 5)
    >>> y = jnp.arange(60).reshape(3, 4, 5)
    >>> jnp.einsum('ijk,jlk->il', x, y)  # explicit form
