    >>> x = jnp.arange(4)
    >>> y = jnp.array([5, 4, 3, 2])

    **Vector product**

    >>> jnp.einsum('i,i', x, y)
    Array(16, dtype=int32)
    >>> jnp.vecdot(x, y)
    Array(16, dtype=int32)

